IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 GRADES.
   05 GRADE OCCURS 30 TIMES ASCENDING KEY STUDENT-ID ASCENDING KEY SUBJECT-ID INDEXED BY GI.
      10 STUDENT-ID PIC 9(5).
      10 SUBJECT-ID PIC 9(3).
